sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant FE as React app
  participant APS as ApplicationService
  participant DB as MySQL
  actor R as Recruiter
  S->>FE: Click "Apply now"
  FE->>APS: POST /api/student/applications {jobId}
  APS->>DB: job open? deadline passed?<br/>resume uploaded? already applied?
  alt a rule fails
    APS-->>FE: 400 or 409 with the reason
  else all rules pass
    APS->>DB: INSERT application (unique job_id + student_id)
    APS-->>FE: 201 status APPLIED
  end
  R->>APS: GET /api/recruiter/jobs/{id}/applicants
  APS->>DB: check the recruiter posted this job
  APS-->>R: applicants ranked by match score, with reasons
  R->>APS: PATCH /applications/{id}/status SHORTLISTED + note
  APS->>DB: check ownership, update status and note
  S->>FE: Open My Applications
  FE-->>S: "Shortlisted" + recruiter note
